Meeting join links are now capability-bearing query-parameter URLs (`<base>/meeting-join/?key=<codeKey>&code=<codeValue>&domain=<domain>`), mirroring conversation join links. The join endpoint becomes `POST /meetings/join?key=<codeKey>&code=<codeValue>` (replacing the V19 `POST /meetings/{domain}/{id}/join/{code}` route before release): the stable `key` addresses the code row and the rotating `code` value is the capability, so refreshing a link invalidates every previously issued URL.
